  "Removes the overlays from all the frames that you move.": "移除所有正在编辑的框架覆盖层。",
  "Pick Frame": "选取框架",
  "Shows the frame under the cursor. Left-click to move it. The mouse wheel picks the frame under it. The frame then shows in the list under \"Your frames\". /move FrameName does the same with the name of a frame.": "点击鼠标下的框架以移动，滚轮选择下层框架。框架会加入“你的框架”。也可使用 /move FrameName。",
