  "The key %s opens MoveAnything! now. It no longer does %s.": "%s 现在打开 MoveAnything!，替代原操作 %s。",
  "The key %s opens MoveAnything! now.": "%s 现在打开 MoveAnything!。",
  "Type /move to open or close the window. Type /move FrameName to move a frame by its name. Type /move pick to pick a frame on the screen. Type /move hide FrameName to hide or show a frame. Type /move done to stop moving all frames. Type /unmove FrameName to put a frame back where the game puts it. Type /move key <key> to set a key for the window. Type /movelist to see the saved layouts, /movecopy Name to copy one and /movedelete Name to delete one.": "命令：/move（窗口）、/move FrameName（移动）、/move pick（选取）、/move hide FrameName（隐藏/显示）、/move done（完成）、/unmove FrameName（重置）、/move key <key>（快捷键）、/movelist（列表）、/movecopy Name（复制）、/movedelete Name（删除）。",
